rem Prime Summations
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=77
rem Find the first value writable as a
rem sum of primes in more than a target
rem number of ways

use linalg
use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Target integer = 5000
option Limit integer = 100

rem Euler transform: n a(n) is the sum
rem of b(k) a(n - k), where b(k) adds
rem the distinct primes dividing k.
rem Solve that lower triangular system
rem for a(0..Limit).
Cells = Limit + 1
Ps = primes to Limit array
Ids = 0 to Limit array
Row = Ids reshape Cells 1
Col = Ids reshape 1 Cells
Dividing = Row mod Ps equal 0
Sums = (Dividing choose Ps 0) sum rank 1
Diff = Row - Col
Valid = Diff greater 0
Spot = Valid choose Diff 0
Size2 = Cells * Cells
Flat = Spot reshape Size2
Picked = Sums Flat
Grid = Picked reshape Cells Cells
Back = Valid choose Grid 0
Diag = (Ids greater 0) choose Ids 1
Eye = Row equal Col choose Diag 0
Mat = Eye - Back
Unit = Ids equal 0 choose 1.0 0.0
Raw = Mat Unit solve
Ways = Raw 0 round
Over = Ways greater Target
Answer = Ways first index where Over
Answer print
